    {
      "is": "IS 4885:1988",
      "clause": "3",
      "title": "General Quality",
      "text": "3. General Quality — Shall be free from cracks, flaws and nodules of lime. shall have plane rectangular faces with sharp edges and corners. Kiln marks not exceeding 3 mm in depth shall be permitted on the opposite edges. When broken, sewer bricks shall show a fracture of uniformly fine grained and compact structure throughout.",
